@startuml Logout_Session_Revocation
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid

title Sequence: User Logout

actor User
participant "Browser\n(auth.js)" as UI
participant "Express Server\n(server.js)" as Server
participant "Auth0" as Auth0

User -> UI : Clicks [Log out]
UI -> Server : GET /auth/logout
note over Server
  express-openid-connect
  (auth0Logout: true)
end note

Server -> UI : Clear session cookie\n302 → Auth0 /v2/logout?returnTo=APP_BASE_URL
note over Server #c8f0c8
  Session (and its tokens) lived only
  in the encrypted cookie: nothing
  server-side to delete
end note

UI -> Auth0 : GET /v2/logout
Auth0 -> Auth0 : End Auth0 SSO session
Auth0 -> UI : 302 → APP_BASE_URL

UI -> Server : GET / , GET /api/auth/status
Server --> UI : { authenticated: false }
UI -> User : Header shows "Guest" + [Log in]\nUser changed (sub → guest): new thread, fresh greeting

User -> UI : "Who am I?"
UI -> Server : POST /api/chat (no session cookie)
Server --> UI : Auth signal again (see diagram 02)

@enduml
